# L §3.1 records: "Fields are named in every literal and read as x.f1". Literal from the table:
# (share: 60 %, base: 12 000.00 PLN); 60 % is 0.6 (L §2.1 "% after a number is the unit 1/100").
=== m.tally
model t
  tally 2
  on 2026-01-01
  start 2026-01-01
  end 2026-12-31

source s "a source"
unit PLN: currency minor 0.01

input r: (share num, base money PLN)

version v
  cite s
  governs always
  known 2026-01-01
  r = (share: 60 %, base: 12 000.00 PLN)

ask q1: r.share, r.base
=== expect
q1: (0.6, 12 000.00 PLN)
  cut 2026-01-01
